<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Operating Agreement - {{entityName}}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            font-size: 12pt;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 1in;
            color: #000;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 14pt;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14pt;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .subsection {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }
        .subsection-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .paragraph {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        .signature-section {
            margin-top: 50px;
            border-top: 1px solid #000;
            padding-top: 30px;
        }
        .signature-block {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .signature-line {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            width: 300px;
            height: 30px;
            margin: 15px 0 5px 0;
        }
        .date-line {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            width: 150px;
            height: 20px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 10pt;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #000;
            padding-top: 15px;
        }
        .address-block {
            margin-left: 20px;
            font-size: 11pt;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <div class="title">OPERATING AGREEMENT</div>
        <div class="subtitle">OF</div>
        <div class="subtitle">{{uppercase entityName}}</div>
        <div class="subtitle">A Texas Limited Liability Company</div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">ARTICLE I - FORMATION</div>
        
        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">1.1 Formation</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                {{safeString entityName}}, a Texas limited liability company (the "Company"), was formed by filing a Certificate of Formation with the Texas Secretary of State on {{formatDate formationDate}}.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">1.2 Name</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                The name of the Company is "{{safeString entityName}}".
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">1.3 Registered Office and Agent</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                The registered office of the Company is located at:
                <div class="address-block">
                    {{safeString registeredOfficeAddress.street}}<br>
                    {{safeString registeredOfficeAddress.city}}, {{safeString registeredOfficeAddress.state}} {{safeString registeredOfficeAddress.zipCode}}
                </div>
                The registered agent is {{safeString registeredAgentName}}.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">1.4 Principal Place of Business</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                The principal place of business of the Company is located at:
                <div class="address-block">
                    {{safeString businessAddress.street}}<br>
                    {{safeString businessAddress.city}}, {{safeString businessAddress.state}} {{safeString businessAddress.zipCode}}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">1.5 Purpose</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                The purpose of the Company is {{#if purpose}}{{safeString purpose}}{{else}}to engage in any lawful act or activity for which a limited liability company may be organized under the Texas Business Organizations Code{{/if}}.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">1.6 Term</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                The Company shall continue {{#if duration}}{{safeString duration}}{{else}}perpetually{{/if}} unless dissolved in accordance with the terms of this Agreement or as provided by law.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">ARTICLE II - MEMBERS</div>
        
        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">2.1 Initial Members</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                The initial members of the Company and their membership interests are as follows:
            </div>
            {{#each initialMembers}}
            <div class="paragraph">
                <strong>{{safeString firstName}} {{safeString lastName}}</strong><br>
                Address: {{formatAddress address}}<br>
                Membership Interest: {{#if membershipPercentage}}{{membershipPercentage}}%{{else}}Equal Share{{/if}}
            </div>
            {{/each}}
        </div>

        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">2.2 Admission of Additional Members</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                No additional members may be admitted to the Company without the unanimous consent of all existing members.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">ARTICLE III - MANAGEMENT</div>
        
        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">3.1 Management Structure</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                {{#ifEquals managementStructure 'member_managed'}}
                The Company shall be managed by its members. Each member shall have the authority to bind the Company in the ordinary course of business.
                {{else}}
                The Company shall be managed by one or more managers appointed by the members. The managers shall have the exclusive authority to manage the business and affairs of the Company.
                {{/ifEquals}}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">3.2 Voting</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                Except as otherwise provided in this Agreement or required by law, all decisions requiring member approval shall be made by majority vote of the members based on their membership interests.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">ARTICLE IV - CAPITAL CONTRIBUTIONS</div>
        
        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">4.1 Initial Contributions</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                Each member's initial capital contribution is as set forth in Schedule A attached hereto and incorporated herein by reference.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">4.2 Additional Contributions</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                No member shall be required to make additional capital contributions without the unanimous consent of all members.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">ARTICLE V - DISTRIBUTIONS</div>
        
        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">5.1 Distributions</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                Distributions shall be made to members in proportion to their membership interests at such times and in such amounts as determined by the members.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">ARTICLE VI - DISSOLUTION</div>
        
        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">6.1 Events of Dissolution</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                The Company shall be dissolved upon the occurrence of any of the following events:
                (a) the unanimous consent of all members;
                (b) the expiration of the term of the Company; or
                (c) any other event that causes dissolution under the Texas Business Organizations Code.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">ARTICLE VII - MISCELLANEOUS</div>
        
        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">7.1 Governing Law</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Texas.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">7.2 Amendment</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                This Agreement may be amended only by the unanimous written consent of all members.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="subsection">
            <div class="subsection-title">7.3 Binding Effect</div>
            <div class="paragraph">
                This Agreement shall be binding upon and inure to the benefit of the members and their respective heirs, successors, and assigns.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="signature-section">
        <div class="section-title">MEMBER SIGNATURES</div>
        <div class="paragraph">
            IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the undersigned members have executed this Operating Agreement as of the date set forth below.
        </div>
        
        {{#each initialMembers}}
        <div class="signature-block">
            <div><strong>{{safeString firstName}} {{safeString lastName}}</strong></div>
            <div class="signature-line"></div>
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Member Signature</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
                Date: <span class="date-line"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
        {{/each}}
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <div>Operating Agreement - {{safeString entityName}}</div>
        <div>Generated on: {{formatDate generatedDate}}</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 9pt;">
            <strong>Important Notice:</strong> This is a basic operating agreement template. 
            Consult with a qualified attorney to ensure it meets your specific needs and complies with applicable law.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
